<view class="instrument"><view class="header"><text>实时实验台</text><text class="status">{{running?'● 通电中':'○ 已断电'}}</text></view><view class="readout"><text class="digits">{{power}}</text><text> W</text><text class="mode">{{calibrated?'复测模式':'观察模式'}}</text></view><canvas type="2d" id="wave" class="wave"/><view class="caption">{{running?'拖动负载滑杆，观察功率与波形响应':'点击通电，启动信号采样'}}</view><slider value="{{load}}" min="20" max="100" step="1" activeColor="#35a9e4" backgroundColor="#d3eaf7" block-color="#70caff" block-size="22" bindchanging="changeLoad" bindchange="changeLoad" aria-label="演示负载"/><view class="header"><text>演示负载 {{load}}%</text><button bindtap="toggle">{{running?'断电':'通电'}} ⏻</button></view><view class="note">波形与功率为交互演示；下方精度题使用独立固定测试数据。</view></view>